        "tags": [
          "scope"
        ],
        "note": "1 row, roadTypeID 4, Urban Restricted Access -- an ON-NETWORK link. `SourceHours` is `SHO` row for row there, `fractionOfOperating` is exactly 1, and the soak modes' weights are exactly 0, so the tank temperature that reaches the output is the all-running one. `run_offNetworkLinkCount` asserts which arm this is.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
