        "note": "The 64-row expected output: 41 gasoline model years 1980-2020 and 23 E85 ones 1998-2020, all of pollutant 1 (THC) at process 11, totalling 24.703317 g. DECLARED AND CONSUMED BY NOTHING -- reading it would transcribe the answer and its extent would transcribe the answer's shape. compare-output.py reads it directly under tolerance.toml.",
        "esio_format": "parquet"
      }
    },
