        "note": "3 rows: 111 (THC x Evap Permeation), 8611 (TOG) and 8711 (VOC). ONLY 111 EMITS: 8611 and 8711 are chained species (`chainedTo1` 8011 and 7911), `runspecchainedto` is empty, and neither rate table carries a row for them, so `rspp_hasRatedRow` discards them -- the rule the fuel-leaks run already exercises from the same three selections one process over.",
